  "info": {
    "title": "ACOP MCP Server",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Reference Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for the Agentic Code Orchestration Protocol (ACOP). Exposes the ACOP coordination write surface — claim, complete, create work item, accept handoff, post blackboard — over stdio JSON-RPC, so MCP-capable agents (Claude Code, Codex, custom harnesses) can drive coordination state via tool calls. Coordination authority is delegated to a pluggable backend adapter; the shipped HTTP adapter targets any ACOP-compatible coordination middleware via a configurable base URI."
  },
